{"id":"question-chinese-content-ab-8","subject":"chinese","type":"single-choice","prompt":"下列詞語中，何者最適合形容「數量很多，無法一一列舉」？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"不勝枚舉"},{"id":"B","text":"不言而喻"},{"id":"C","text":"不置可否"},{"id":"D","text":"不翼而飛"}],"knowledgeIds":["kg-chinese-content-ab"],"difficulty":"easy","answer":{"value":"A","explanation":"『不勝枚舉』指多得不能一一列舉；B 是不用說就明白，C 是不表示同意或反對，D 是未經察覺就離去或失蹤。"},"provenance":{"origin":"original","license":"All rights reserved","sourceUrl":"https://www.sdjh.ntpc.edu.tw/var/file/0/1000/attach/16/pta_2229_1166226_19803.pdf","sourceLocator":"新北市立三多國中 112 學年度第一學期第二次段考國文科；成語辨析題型能力目標，本題獨立改編","authoringNote":"獨立改編，非原題重製。"},"reviewStatus":"draft","updatedAt":"2026-08-28","lessonId":"lesson-chinese-content-ab"}
